<p>Increases weapon damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">29%, 42%, 51%, 59%, 66%</acronym> and Physical Power by 30 when using steamguns.</p><p>Also, increases your reload rate by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 1, 2, 2.</acronym></p>